        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Hollow Knight: Silksong is the epic sequel to Hollow Knight, the epic action-adventure of bugs and heroes. As the lethal hunter Hornet, journey to all-new lands, discover new powers, battle vast hordes of bugs and beasts and uncover ancient secrets tied to your nature and your past.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Hollow Knight: Silksong es la épica secuela de Hollow Knight, la gran aventura de acción de insectos y héroes. Como la letal cazadora Hornet, viaja a tierras completamente nuevas, descubre nuevos poderes, combate hordas de insectos y bestias, y desentierra antiguos secretos ligados a tu naturaleza y a tu pasado.",
          "source": "claude",
